1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,520
For adults under family or relationship pressure: think privately,
then explore lived experience on your terms.

2
00:00:14,664 --> 00:00:21,589
Arjun starts with uncertainty. The reply is a prepared local
example, not a connected model.

3
00:00:22,164 --> 00:00:26,879
It misses the point. He says Not quite and rewrites what is
happening.

4
00:00:31,934 --> 00:00:37,889
He can talk with his partner. The pressure is from his parents; he
needs time to decide.

5
00:00:46,197 --> 00:00:55,517
The reflection now changes, and Arjun can edit it. Muse Spark is
planned to organize a reflection he can correct; no model is
connected.

6
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:07,130
Day four: Ravi describes wanting space to choose while caring
about family.

7
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:13,890
Another member asks what feels hardest before giving advice.

8
00:01:16,909 --> 00:01:22,004
Day nine: the conversation became an argument and the outcome
remains open.

9
00:01:24,909 --> 00:01:29,959
A fictional host asks everyone to listen first, without choosing
for Arjun.

10
00:01:32,082 --> 00:01:38,207
A prepared moderation example appears briefly. No report or
reviewer is contacted.

11
00:01:43,209 --> 00:01:49,429
Day sixteen: Dev's side question remains unanswered. The thread
promises no reply.

12
00:01:58,613 --> 00:02:03,898
Arjun opens a group-only question for Ravi, then edits the exact
wording.

13
00:02:05,613 --> 00:02:11,958
The changed preview keeps his alias, excludes private context, and
leaves consent off.

14
00:02:16,020 --> 00:02:19,965
No professional provider is verified or bookable here.

15
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:25,980
He returns to peer perspectives; no provider was found.

16
00:02:26,395 --> 00:02:33,130
Arjun keeps one takeaway privately: he wants a conversation
without someone deciding for him.

17
00:02:38,644 --> 00:02:43,589
He selects Offer one thing that helped and edits a bounded local
draft to Dev.

18
00:02:44,644 --> 00:02:50,219
Only this sentence and the group audience would be considered;
private context stays out.

19
00:02:50,644 --> 00:02:56,224
Consent is unchecked, posting is disabled, and this draft remains
unsent.
